config BR2_PACKAGE_T48_WEB
	bool "t48-web"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBT48
	select BR2_PACKAGE_T48_SHELL
	help
	  The phone's web setup page, from webconfig/ in this repo: a small
	  HTTP server for the LAN, off until the owner turns it on at
	  the phone's screen. See docs/web.md.
